    source: https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium646.pdf
    notes: DSMZ646 explicitly prepares Difco0045 Blood Agar Base at40g/L, sterilizes
      and cools it before separately adding5% sterile defibrinated rabbit OR sheep
      blood. This owner is that prepared base before blood addition. Complete historical
      powder composition and water specification are absent; the known dry-product
      contribution is retained as a partial assertion without selecting an animal
      blood supplement.
